{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101766","id":2797092061,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6muDzd","number":101766,"title":"[4.4.beta1] Editor dialogs obscured while running the game in \"Single Window Mode\"","user":{"login":"AlmostBiley","id":69011843,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDExODQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69011843?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley","html_url":"https://github.com/AlmostBiley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-01-18T17:33:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T18:12:15Z","closed_at":"2025-01-18T17:37:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700S (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.12024.2005) - AMD Ryzen 9 6900HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOpening any Godot dialog while the editor is in \"Single Window Mode\", the game is running, and the editor is switched to the Game tab will open the dialog behind the game view, and any other control of the editor will be blocked until the dialog is closed.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1f0e79e-4f18-4873-aec5-5ee276edfb67)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project in 4.4.beta1.\n2. In Editor Settings -> Interface -> Editor, enable \"Single Window Mode\".\n3. Create a Node2D and save it as a scene.\n4. Run current scene or run project and select the new scene as the root scene.\n5. The game will launch embedded in the editor under the Game tab.\n6. Open any dialog in Godot (project settings, editor settings, add child node, anything really.)\n7. The dialog will open behind the game window.\n8. Any other editor controls (besides the mostly-obscured dialog controls) are unusable until the dialog is closed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nShould be unnecessary as this bug is related to editor settings.","closed_by":{"login":"AlmostBiley","id":69011843,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDExODQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69011843?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley","html_url":"https://github.com/AlmostBiley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlmostBiley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101766/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}